Gyaarweh moula ki hoti hai shahadat haye haye<br>
Samere me kyu na barpa ho qayamat haye haye<br>
<br>
Seena o sar peet kar roe'n na kyu kar mominee'n<br>
Ho rahe hai aaj moula ham se ruqsat haye haye<br>
<br>
Puchiye qairul bashar se, haidare karrar se<br>
Samera me kis ki hai shahadat haye haye<br>
<br>
Keh rahi hai qaak udha kar murtaza se fatima<br>
Askari ki zehr se hai ghair haalat haye haye<br>
<br>
Ho rahe hai'n aaj hilmi hazrate hujjat yateem<br>
Kya qayamat hai yateemi aur ghurbat haye haye